{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Design your processor, define your strategy, dominate the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this innovative tycoon game, revolutionize the tech world by developing your very own custom processors! Manage your production line, optimize your hardware architecture, and compete with rival companies to become the market leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to climb to the top of the tech world? Build your own chip empire and leave your mark on processor history! \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Processor_Combination.png?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decide on core count, efficiency, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Processor_Gif_raw.gif?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/R_D.png?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new technologies to build more powerful and efficient CPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/R_D_Gif_Raw.gif?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Specific_Area.png?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design customized areas for different use scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Area_Gif_Raw.gif?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Architecture_Design.png?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create microarchitectures at the hardware level and push performance to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Architecture_Gif_raw.gif?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/extras/Mini_Story.png?t=1747519206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small but deep story awaits you. Make deals with mysterious figures, choose your own path \u2014 right or wrong, it's up to you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600280?t=1747519206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/d96f4b66e7c15aa28fd907d435db3ae5637afd50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747519206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/a846519c4ba9346f0d742c28797a6cc9b5aab5cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747519206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600280/a846519c4ba9346f0d742c28797a6cc9b5aab5cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747519206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3740330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Design your processor, define your strategy, dominate the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this innovative tycoon game, revol